{
  "name": "New roles at target companies to Slack (ATS Job Changes Feed)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "fb525746-620f-5f76-a977-8666f09c44bd",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New or reopened roles at your target companies → Slack\n\n### How it works\nEvery morning this workflow runs the ATS Job Changes Feed Actor on Apify for the companies you list. The Actor reads their public Greenhouse, Lever or Ashby job boards and remembers what it saw on the previous run of the same `monitorId`. The filters keep job records that are **new** or **reopened** since then, and each one is posted to Slack as one message with the title, company, locations and link.\n\nThe first run only records the current openings and posts nothing. A run with no changes posts nothing, so a role is never announced twice.\n\n### Setup\n1. In Apify, copy your API token (Settings → API & Integrations).\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential with Name `Authorization` and Value `Bearer <your token>`, and select it in **Run ATS Job Changes Feed**.\n3. In the same node, edit `companies` in the JSON body: `greenhouse:<board>`, a Greenhouse, Lever or Ashby board URL, or a careers-page URL.\n4. In Slack, create an incoming webhook and paste its URL into **Post to Slack**.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n- Change or remove `titleKeywords`, or add `locationKeywords`.\n- Use a different `monitorId` for each watch list.\n- Change the schedule in **Every morning**.\n\nThe Actor is pay-per-event on Apify (unchanged jobs are free) and `maxTotalChargeUsd` caps each run. The request waits up to 5 minutes, so split very long company lists. Built by AGI Tools, the Actor's publisher.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fetch changes since the last run\nRuns the Actor and waits for its results. Only records that changed since this monitor's previous run come back. If Apify fails or times out, the execution stops with an error and nothing is posted.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fc19528f-26f2-5309-8025-f7f0165314a1",
      "name": "Section: fetch changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alert on new and reopened roles\nKeeps only job records whose change is new or reopened, then posts one Slack message per role. n8n encodes the message, so quotes or line breaks in job titles are safe.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ddf65db8-c34e-557d-b992-820dead975b3",
      "name": "Section: alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "869d49ac-98da-58fe-939b-045ee4eee20f",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3a587945-4822-5cfb-8605-c561608bece3",
      "name": "Run ATS Job Changes Feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Credential: Header Auth, name 'Authorization', value 'Bearer <your Apify API token>'. Keep monitorId unchanged between runs: it is the memory that makes each run return only changes. maxTotalChargeUsd caps what one run can cost.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/agitools~ats-jobs-delta/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "clean",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"companies\": [\n    \"greenhouse:stripe\",\n    \"https://jobs.lever.co/palantir\",\n    \"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/openai\"\n  ],\n  \"monitorId\": \"n8n-slack-alerts\",\n  \"mode\": \"changes\",\n  \"emitBaseline\": false,\n  \"includeClosed\": false,\n  \"includeDescription\": false,\n  \"emitCompanySummaries\": false,\n  \"titleKeywords\": [\n    \"engineer\",\n    \"data\"\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2ebf41bd-5af8-5dcb-b863-29fdc17bd08f",
      "name": "Jobs only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "168238cc-c987-5235-b3c3-7d08193e6a3c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.recordType }}",
              "rightValue": "job",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1dfd3aec-6f53-513d-acc3-bd3de4223d4b",
      "name": "New or reopened",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6a6dbd97-ba22-5e34-b0f4-cbcddf57780c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.changeType }}",
              "rightValue": "new",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "30daa7e5-981a-5ab9-92eb-05c65fc5132b",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.changeType }}",
              "rightValue": "reopened",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bca93e42-aa4a-5330-b71c-819dc6015d45",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Replace the URL with your own Slack incoming-webhook URL.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://hooks.slack.com/services/REPLACE/WITH/YOUR_WEBHOOK",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $json.changeType === 'reopened' ? 'Reopened' : 'New' }} role at {{ $json.companyName || $json.companySlug }}: {{ $json.title }} ({{ ($json.locations || []).join(', ') }}) {{ $json.url }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run ATS Job Changes Feed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run ATS Job Changes Feed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Jobs only",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Jobs only": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "New or reopened",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "New or reopened": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
